=\"1.0\" font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\">Configure MultiLink PPP according to the diagram.\n\nConfigure R1 and R2 only.  \nThe service provider routers have been pre-configured.\n\nAfter configuring MLPPP, configure static default routes\nto the SPR routers on R1 and R2, and try to ping from one\nrouter to the other.</text></svg>", "x": -217, "y": 131, "z": 1}, {"drawing_id": "c9ea2ad0-2717-4d83-a4a6-d04585baafa8", "rotation": 0, "svg": "<svg height=\"104\" width=\"267\"><text fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\" font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\">MLPPP with two-way PAP authentication\nUsername: Packet\nPassword: Tracer\n\nSent username: Cisco\nSent password: CCNA</text></svg>", "x": -485, "y": 38, "z": 1}, {"drawing_id": "3251dde8-5023-4613-b8e6-ff8626416aed", "rotation": 0, "svg": "<svg height=\"40\" width=\"277\"><text fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\" font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\">MLPPP with two-way CHAP authentication\nPassword: CCNA</text></svg>", "x": 131, "y": 53, "z": 1}], "links": [{"filters": {}, "link_id": "dc512fc3-f465-45a8-ae91-74dc4f346c37", "nodes": [{"adapter_number": 1, "label": {"rotation": 0, "style": "font-family: TypeWriter;font-size: 10.0;font-weight: bold;fill: #000000;fill-opacity: 1.0;", "text": "s1/0", "x": 40, "y": 40}, "node_id": "c249474c-46fb-4e0c-8dc1-27404588410f", "port_number": 0}, {"adapter_number": 1, "label": {"rotation": 0, "style": "font-family: TypeWriter;font-size: 10.0;font-weight: bold;fill: #000000;fill-opacity: 1.0;", "text": "s1/0", "x": 40, "y": 40}, "node_id": "ca6525e4-984e-4a0b-aff1-f72867682f4d", "port_number": 0}], "suspend": false}, {"filters": {}, "link_id": "d92bb36a-e08c-4970-823c-c01daa2e9c7f", "nodes": [{"adapter_number": 1, "label": {"rotation": 0, "style": "font-family: TypeWriter;font-size: 10.0;font-weight: bold;fill: #000000;fill-opacity: 1.0;", "text": "s1/1", "x": 41, "y": 35}, "node_id": "c24